    "title": "Approved Rehabilitation and Resettlement Scheme to be made public",
    "description": "18. Approved Rehabilitation and Resettlement Scheme to be made public.—The Commissioner shall cause the approved Rehabilitation and Resettlement Scheme to be made available in the local language to the Panchayat, Municipality or Municipal Corporation, as the case may be, and the offices of the District Collector, the Sub-Divisional Magistrate and the Tehsil, and shall be published in the affected areas, in such manner as may be prescribed, and uploaded on the website of the appropriate Government.",
