    "title": "Additional compensation in case of multiple displacements",
    "description": "39. Additional compensation in case of multiple displacements.—The Collector shall, as far as possible, not displace any family which has already been displaced by the appropriate Government for the purpose of acquisition under the provisions of this Act, and if so displaced, shall pay an additional compensation equivalent to that of the compensation determined under this Act for the second or successive displacements.",
    "metaData": "Chapter V REHABILITATION AND RESETTLEMENT AWARD",
    "metaDescription": "THE RIGHT TO FAIR COMPENSATION AND TRANSPARENCY IN LAND ACQUISITION, REHABILITATION AND RESETTLEMENT ACT, 2013 Section 39 - Additional compensation in case of multiple displacements",
    "metaTitle": "Section 39 - THE RIGHT TO FAIR COMPENSATION AND TRANSPARENCY IN LAND ACQUISITION, REHABILITATION AND RESETTLEMENT ACT, 2013"
